# Everything under data/ is runtime state, and some of it is secret:
#   users.json    scrypt hashes + salts  (0600, but never commit it)
#   sessions.json hashed session tokens
#   audit.jsonl   who called what, when
#   history.json  several MB of time series, rewritten every 2 minutes
/data/
/*.log
*.tmp

config/local.json

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.swp

# local agent worktrees and settings
.claude/

# working notes stay on the working machine (never published)
worklog/
docs/STATE-*.md
